# ============================================================================
# VALIDATION LAYER (path canonicalization helpers)
# This file IS the path-traversal defense for Layer 3 semantic analyzers.
# It implements validate_and_canonicalize() + boundary checks; consumers
# (shell.rs, make.rs, idioms/loader.rs) call into it specifically so the
# raw filesystem reads happen behind a validated boundary.
#
# Self-scanning a sanitizer flags its own sink (the read after the check)
# as if the check did not exist. That is the well-known taint-mode false
# positive class for validation libraries. Excluding this single file
# preserves the rule's value everywhere else while letting the sanitizer
# do its job.
# ============================================================================

loctree-rs/src/semantic/io.rs
